O-2n&_nc_oc=AdrgixCpn7I3DmFqM_JiRvmze1sqOngSVEK_5hEMUvA_AgtYjx9BrNjmOSDboq5BPF8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMpfOAux5jPxsn3ZSa9KEAqitpDrSvTraOfq-k69fQ73g&oe=6ADE17B2"}, {"file_name": "Symphoni-Screenshot-04.png", "id": "473694689137535", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393320_473694692470868_5425549575320582278_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i9pnY6RVjrMQ7kNvwGWoJRG&_nc_oc=Adqu5M-Q3twGel8XHzEjeoUpLOtfIO1G_QJK2xxW4Ij05F6NX7VUGfXAtvYc8azEjOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPt52zOjeRKs1KUvVfPT_I_rgN__mp6VlNXpVsBBFqQ_g&oe=6ADE0FEC"}, {"file_name": "Symphoni-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "1349648676476742", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391862_1349648679810075_447301309409170078_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6IyRDPBQD7MQ7kNvwFZbrH-&_nc_oc=AdrDe_Zty4TExUr1YUZJH-yPmWEd_SkhzPMx6z-OoGQV7O-wN17oXxAEA3gFcBO8yqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOTQkhnvUbuD_shp_IzTUPT2YXtVrgnUDL5f3cTH0wK8w&oe=6ADDFAF1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PUB_Symphoni_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "9364163683649872", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393723_9364163690316538_1881822928577390435_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PaBH122hyg4Q7kNvwFdEWRD&_nc_oc=AdrccliQoursQB4Rk1oqMyf49LIYtkbTPXFHsD32kScXFZ0M9hE1ZLYanCwKO4Nb8vI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPhbwHRE9W0rt7FdPkfW6J2VkAZ1YsxSH5Zx-2upNnoHA&oe=6ADE202B"}, "display_name": "Symphoni", "keywords": ["Conducting", "Maestro", "Wizard", "Magic", "Rhythm"], "long_description": "# Wave Your Wand. Command the Music. Become the Wizard of Symphonies.\nWelcome to **Symphoni**, where you can be a grand musical wizard who breathes new life into classical music. Unlike traditional rhythm games, **Symphoni** lets you conduct, cast spells, and transform reality while grooving to the classics.\n{1043215534309263}{664540836007804}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udfbc Wield the Power of Music\nConduct the symphony with your wand and cast spellbinding portals to the rhythm of classical masterpieces.\n{633925752354407}\n\n# \ud83c\udf0e Step Into Magical Realms\nExperience visually stunning MR transitions as your living room transforms into enchanted symphonic worlds.\n{1017135330244800}\n# \ud83c\udfb5 16 Timeless Masterpieces\nChallenge yourself with Tchaikovsky, Beethoven, and more across three difficulty levels and four magical realms.\n{921407033308625}\n# \ud83d\udd2e Collect Wands & Unlock Crystals\nLevel up your magical abilities, unlock 25 unique achievement crystals, and collect four legendary wands.\n{2753157158218964}{602916329194974}\n# \ud83e\ude84 Master the Magic of Motion\nPlay using **hand-tracking** for an immersive conducting experience, or use **controllers** for precise rhythmic gameplay.\n{1132195501699773}\n# \ud83d\udcdd Symphoni Creator (Coming Soon)\nCompose your own musical challenges and try out **user-generated Symphonies**.\n{971665371137427}\n#  \u2728 Experience the Magic of Music\nWith **16 masterpieces, 3 difficulties, wand collections, collectible crystals, and a custom song editor + free song updates** planned in the near future, get ready to raise your wand and experience the magic of classical music like never before.\n", "short_description": "Welcome to Symphoni, where you can be a grand musical wizard who breathes new life into classical music. Unlike traditional rhythm games, Symphoni lets you conduct, cast spells, and transform reality while grooving tothe classics.\n\nWith 16 masterpieces, 3 difficulties, wand collections, collectible crystals, and a custom song editor + free song updates planned in the near future, get ready to raise your wand and experience the magic of classical music like never before."}]}, "developer_name": "techToy Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https